</div>

<title>Response to Student Thinking</title>

<para>At the start of the next lesson, consider reviewing the strategy of rewriting equations with subtraction as equivalent equations with addition (and similarly teaching the strategy “always add” and “multiply by a negative”) for students who struggle with subtracting entire equations.</para></section>
